下面归并排序的合并函数在把合并结果写入 tmp 之后，必须再复制回原数组 a，否则排序结果不会生效。

```cpp
void merge(vector<int> &a, vector<int> &tmp, int l, int mid, int r) {
    int i = l, j = mid + 1, k = l;
    while (i <= mid && j <= r)
        tmp[k++] = (a[i] <= a[j]) ? a[i++] : a[j++];
    while (i <= mid) tmp[k++] = a[i++];
    while (j <= r) tmp[k++] = a[j++];
    for (int t = l; t <= r; t++) a[t] = tmp[t];
}
```

